Z||000001||AkursedX||12-16-2001||08:46 PM||||If those would have been around when I was buying rims, I would have bought them in a second.  Those are quite possibly the best looking rims I have ever seen!  <P>The best prices I have seen on them have been at <A HREF="http://www.discounttiredirect.com" TARGET=_blank>www.discounttiredirect.com</A>  , around 180 bucks a piece or so.  <P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
