Z||000014||SwissFormula||12-17-2001||01:01 PM||||Does anybody KNOW FOR SURE that 18x7.5 with 235 or 245/40/18 will fit in the back of a Formula without modification? 40 offset should be ok?<P>I've seen this awesome wheels 3 or 4 month ago, didn't buy them because i wanted something larger than 7" rear. Adding shipping & taxes its gonna be a "notsocheap" thing, buying 18's hopeing they will fit was to much risk for me.<BR>I really need to buy new rear tires and the original 15" rims are bad (paint comes off). Its now or never...<P>------------------<BR>Roy<P>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||1
Z||000015||artherd||12-18-2001||06:45 AM||||That size will fit quite easially on the rear of any 88  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Go 7" in front if you can, but with say a 225/40/18 tyre, the 7.5s will work fine in front too)  Try and find 45-50mm offset fronts if you can, the rears are perfect at 40mm!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by SwissFormula:<BR><B>Does anybody KNOW FOR SURE that 18x7.5 with 235 or 245/40/18 will fit in the back of a Formula without modification? 40 offset should be ok?<P>I've seen this awesome wheels 3 or 4 month ago, didn't buy them because i wanted something larger than 7" rear. Adding shipping & taxes its gonna be a "notsocheap" thing, buying 18's hopeing they will fit was to much risk for me.<BR>I really need to buy new rear tires and the original 15" rims are bad (paint comes off). Its now or never...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
